  "soundHelp": "When discussion time ends, a short sound plays and the phone vibrates.",
  "flowText2": "You choose the number of spies in setup — from zero up to every player. So there may be no spy at all, or everyone may be a spy! Spies don't know who the other spies are. If \"Tell players how many spies there are\" is on, everyone sees the number; otherwise nobody knows it. When voting, instead of a player you can pick \"There is no spy\": if there really was none, the citizens win; if there was one, the spies win. If you eject someone and there was no spy, nobody wins (unless the Joker or the Saboteur wins)."
